+        prefix must be the exact common-prefix length and smaller than limit.
+        Return None if its two suffix deficits leave too many alignments.
+        Otherwise every possible improvement crosses a cut in a short prefix;
+        self-comparison of the shared long prefix reduces to small-period
+        automata, followed by bounded explicit tail comparisons.
+        """
+        a = self.arena
